WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.923
The plan turns the owners'
answers into one action each,

2
00:00:03.923 --> 00:00:05.988
and only two kinds ever write.

3
00:00:05.988 --> 00:00:10.119
Removing an application permission
happens through the resource,

4
00:00:10.119 --> 00:00:14.399
and only once any replacement, like
selected sites, is already in place.

5
00:00:14.399 --> 00:00:18.725
Narrowing a delegated grant can
only make it smaller, never empty.

6
00:00:18.725 --> 00:00:23.116
Everything else is recorded: waiting
for a decision or a replacement,

7
00:00:23.116 --> 00:00:27.507
kept under an exception, or handed
to someone else's reviewed process,

8
00:00:27.507 --> 00:00:31.050
such as re-scoping an Azure
role in infrastructure code.

9
00:00:31.050 --> 00:00:36.890
As before, identical inputs give an identical
file, so a reviewer approves one hash.
